<view class="page"><view class="vi-brand-row"><image class="vi-corporate-logo" src="/assets/brand/betech-logo-orange.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>Beline Home</text></view><view class="eyebrow">Beline Home OPERATIONS</view><view class="h1">{{title}}</view><view class="muted">{{room.project}} · {{room.number}} 室</view><view class="notice">全部为本地模拟操作，不签约、不扣款、不连接真实硬件。</view><block wx:if="{{kind==='checkin'}}"><view class="field"><text>住户姓名（虚构）</text><input data-field="name" bindinput="input" placeholder="请输入演示住户姓名"/></view><view class="field"><text>手机号码（虚构）</text><input type="number" maxlength="11" data-field="phone" bindinput="input" placeholder="11位演示手机号"/></view><view class="field"><text>租约开始日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{form.start}}" data-field="start" bindchange="input"><view class="select">{{form.start}}</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text>租约结束日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{form.end}}" data-field="end" bindchange="input"><view class="select">{{form.end}}</view></picker></view><view class="grid"><view class="field"><text>月租（元）</text><input type="digit" value="{{form.rent}}" data-field="rent" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="field"><text>押金（元）</text><input type="digit" value="{{form.deposit}}" data-field="deposit" bindinput="input"/></view></view></block>
<block wx:if="{{kind==='repair'}}"><view class="field"><text>故障类型</text><picker range="{{types}}" bindchange="type"><view class="select">{{form.type}}</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text>问题描述</text><textarea data-field="description" bindinput="input" placeholder="请描述问题，方便管家安排处理" maxlength="500"/></view></block>
<block wx:if="{{kind==='device'}}"><view class="card"><view class="strong">{{deviceOnline?'设备在线':'设备离线 / 未安装'}}</view><view class="sub">{{room.lockSerial}} / {{room.electricSerial}} / {{room.waterSerial}}</view></view><view class="field"><text>模拟操作</text><picker range="{{actions}}" bindchange="action"><view class="select">{{form.action}}</view></picker></view></block>
<block wx:if="{{kind==='checkout'}}"><view class="card"><view class="row"><text>住户</text><text>{{room.resident}}</text></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="row"><text>待结算费用</text><text>{{dueText}}</text></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="row"><text>{{differenceLabel}}</text><text class="amount">{{differenceText}}</text></view><view class="muted">只展示已有账单和押金差额，实际结算还需末次抄表与验房。未模拟实际退款。</view></view></block>
<block wx:if="{{kind==='lease-renew'}}"><view class="card"><view class="strong">{{room.resident}}</view><view class="muted">原租约至 {{room.end}}</view></view><view class="field"><text>续租至</text><picker mode="date" value="{{form.end}}" data-field="end" bindchange="input"><view class="select">{{form.end}}</view></picker></view></block>
<block wx:if="{{kind==='move'}}"><view class="field"><text>目标空房</text><picker range="{{targets}}" range-key="selectorText" value="{{targetIndex}}" bindchange="target"><view class="select">{{targets.length?targets[targetIndex].selectorText:'暂无空房'}}</view></picker></view><view class="muted">保留原房历史账单，沿用租约和押金，新房按台账月租展示，不自动生成差价。</view></block>
<block wx:if="{{kind==='grant'}}"><view class="field"><text>授权对象</text><input data-field="name" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如：演示访客"/></view><view class="field"><text>有效至（演示日期之后）</text><input value="{{form.end}}" data-field="end" bindinput="input" placeholder="2026-10-25T18:00"/></view><view class="muted">只生成授权记录，不生成真实密码或电子钥匙。</view></block><button class="primary wide" bindtap="submit">确认{{kind==='repair'?'提交报修':'模拟操作'}}</button></view>
